      "front": "A 900 kg car travels at 20 m/s round a bend of radius 50 m. Calculate the centripetal force needed.",
      "back": "7200 N",
      "answerType": "NUMERIC",
      "keyPoints": [
        {
          "text": "7200",
          "synonyms": [
            "7200 N",
            "7.2 kN"
          ],
          "mustInclude": true
        }
      ],
      "mcq": {
        "correct": "7200 N",
        "distractors": [
          "360 N",
          "360000 N",
          "18000 N"
        ]
      },
      "explanation": "F = mv^2/r = 900 x 20^2 / 50 = 7200 N, supplied by friction between the tyres and the road.",
